# T-2118 regression: document-level Boolean type must resolve correctly.
# Before the FrameKind fix, fn-body DictLetrec frames could contaminate the
# body_slot_base computation for DocSequential frames, causing Boolean.True
# to be unresolvable and the match to produce a type error (output: []).
[
  Boolean: [type True False]
  result: [match Boolean.True
    Boolean.True:  "correct"
    Boolean.False: "wrong"
    ...:           "wrong"]
]
---
%.result
=== out
String("correct")
=== warn
never consumed by the next pipeline stage
